      "subtype": null,
      "summary": "The proof treats weight-one vertices by the norm-one lemma; otherwise it roots components obtained by removing the unique underweighted vertex, proves them admissible, and rules out any decomposition in the cases p≥1 and p=0 using the rooted estimate and root bound.",
      "title": "Final irreducibility proof by rooted components",
