  "overview": "Self-contained source corpus for the positive-definite integer-weighted tree-lattice theorem. problem.tex states the lattice, irreducibility, and unique-underweighted-vertex conclusion; solution.tex proves it via norm-one elements, admissible rooted components, capacities, a rooted integer estimate, and a final decomposition contradiction. formal_target.lean fixes the Lean-facing pairing, vertex vectors, irreducibility predicate, and required exported theorem; README.md records provenance, reading order, and extraction limits.",
